cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these results, cite them via this metadata."
title: "Hadamard-M: an erratum at order 515, and an explicit Hadamard matrix of order 7796"
abstract: >-
  Two results on Miyamoto's 1991 construction of Hadamard matrices. First, an
  erratum at order 515 — the only claim at Hadamard order 2060 located in our
  dated audit of the literature: a parity obstruction shows that the paper's
  Corollary 4 cannot supply the order-103 ingredient the entry needs, and the
  same test decides the paper's printed entries at 83, 103, 127 and 151,
  admitting 83 and ruling out the other three. Second, the same paper's main
  theorem, applied to a publicly announced Hadamard matrix of order 1948, gives
  an explicit Hadamard matrix of order 7796, verified in exact integer
  arithmetic at a pinned digest. AI-generated results with a human
  managing the workflow — produced by Claude Code (Fable 5, Anthropic);
  external reviews by GPT 5.6 (OpenAI) and by Grok (xAI), intaken and
  adjudicated; see DISCLOSURE.md.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-30
url: "https://github.com/JD-Jones-ASES/Hadamard-M"
